@lang en
IMPORT `vn11-nouns`

-- Manulife Vietnam term life product terms, row VN-11: Article 1 (definitions) and Article 2 (the
-- contract). The document's heading states its vintage on its own showing: an attachment to a
-- letter of the Ministry of Finance of 2002, whose number, day and month are blank as extracted.
-- src:1 | Điều khoản sản phẩm bảo hiểm tử kỳ có thời hạn
-- src:3 | (Kèm theo Công văn số
-- src:5 | TC/TCNH ngày
-- src:52 | năm 2002 của Bộ Tài Chính)

§ `Article 1 — Definitions`

§§ `Art 1.1 and 1.2 — the Company and the policyholder`

-- Encoded as parties in vn11-nouns.l4 (`A party`). The rest of each definition says that the party
-- has the rights and duties the contract gives it, which no rule reads.

§§ `Art 1.3 — the insured: residence and Age at issue`

-- src:28 | vào lúc được cấp Hợp đồng bảo hiểm. Tuổi
-- src:29 | cấp Hợp đồng bảo hiểm của Người được bảo
-- src:30 | hiểm là từ 0 (không) Tuổi đến 60 (sáu mươi)
-- Both conditions are tested on the issue date ("vào lúc được cấp Hợp đồng bảo hiểm",
-- "Tuổi cấp Hợp đồng bảo hiểm"). "từ 0 (không) Tuổi đến 60 (sáu mươi) Tuổi" is read as
-- inclusive at both ends (fork F4). The document says what follows when either condition fails
-- only for a misstated Age (Art 9); see `the outcome of the death claim` in vn11-death-claim.l4.
@ref Art 1.3, src:26-31
GIVEN `the Age` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 1.3 — an Age from 0 to 60` `the Age` MEANS
        `the Age` AT LEAST 0
    AND `the Age` AT MOST 60

@ref Art 1.3, src:26-31; Art 7, src:201-203
GIVEN `the insured person` IS A `The insured`
      `the page`           IS A `The contract page`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 1.3 — the insured met the residence and Age conditions when the contract was issued` `the insured person` `the page` MEANS
        `the insured person`'s `resided in Vietnam on the issue date`
    AND `Art 1.3 — an Age from 0 to 60` (`the Age of` `the insured person` `on` (`the page`'s `issue date`))

-- Neither Art 1.3 nor Art 7 says what follows from a contract issued although a condition failed
-- (finding 10). Art 9 answers only for a misstated Age.
@ref Art 1.3, src:26-28; Art 7, src:201-203
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Arts 1.3 and 7 do not say what follows when the insured did not reside in Vietnam on the issue date` MEANS
    REFUSE "Arts 1.3 and 7 do not say what follows when the insured did not reside in Vietnam on the issue date"

@ref Art 1.3, src:28-31
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Art 1.3 does not say what follows when the contract was issued at an Age outside 0 to 60 that was not misstated` MEANS
    REFUSE "Art 1.3 does not say what follows when the contract was issued at an Age outside 0 to 60 that was not misstated"

§§ `Art 1.4 — Age`

-- src:32 | 1.4. Tuổi: Tuổi có nghĩa là tuổi vào ngày sinh
-- src:33 | nhật vừa qua của Người được bảo hiểm.
-- Age is the age at the insured's last birthday. A birthday is the anniversary of the true date of
-- birth, found with `add years`, which puts a 29 February birthday on 28 February in a common year
-- (fork F2).
@ref Art 1.4, src:32-33
GIVEN `the person` IS A `The insured`
      `the day`    IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Age of` `the person` `on` `the day` MEANS
    IF   `add years` (`the person`'s `true date of birth`) `the years between` AT MOST `the day`
    THEN `the years between`
    ELSE `the years between` MINUS 1
    WHERE
        `the years between` MEANS DATE_YEAR `the day` MINUS DATE_YEAR (`the person`'s `true date of birth`)

§§ `Art 1.5 — contract years, anniversaries, the maturity date; a valid application`

-- The dates themselves are on the contract page (vn11-nouns.l4). Which day the effective date is
-- ("tính theo ngày ký Đơn yêu cầu bảo hiểm và được Công ty chấp thuận": the signing day once
-- accepted, or the day of acceptance) is fork F1; the encoding takes the contract page's date.
@ref Art 1.5, src:34-42
GIVEN `n`        IS A NUMBER
      `the page` IS A `The contract page`
GIVETH A DATE
`contract anniversary number` `n` `of` `the page` MEANS
    `add years` (`the page`'s `effective date`) `n`

-- src:44 | lệ phải được Bên mua bảo hiểm và Người
-- src:45 | được bảo hiểm ký.
-- The document does not say what follows from an application that is not valid in this sense.
@ref Art 1.5, src:43-45
GIVEN `the form` IS A `The application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 1.5 — the application is valid` `the form` MEANS
        `the form`'s `signed by the policyholder`
    AND `the form`'s `signed by the insured`

-- The insured of Age 0 that Art 1.3 admits cannot sign, and the document provides no one to sign
-- for the insured (finding 10).
@ref Art 1.5, src:43-45
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Art 1.5 does not say what follows when the application was not signed by both the policyholder and the insured` MEANS
    REFUSE "Art 1.5 does not say what follows when the application was not signed by both the policyholder and the insured"

§§ `Art 1.6 — the contract term`

-- src:55 | thời hạn tính từ Ngày hiệu lực Hợp đồng đến
-- src:56 | ngày đáo hạn của Hợp đồng bảo hiểm.
-- "từ Ngày hiệu lực Hợp đồng đến ngày đáo hạn": both days are in the term (fork F5).
@ref Art 1.6, src:54-56
GIVEN `the page` IS A `The contract page`
      `the day`  IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 1.6 — the day falls in the contract term` `the page` `the day` MEANS
        `the day` AT LEAST `the page`'s `effective date`
    AND `the day` AT MOST  `the page`'s `maturity date`

§ `Article 2 — The contract`

§§ `Art 2, first paragraph — what the complete contract is`

-- src:65 | ý của Bên mua bảo hiểm sẽ tạo thành một hợp
-- src:66 | đồng hoàn chỉnh. Bất kỳ chấp thuận nào sau này
-- Inert: it names the documents that make up the contract and decides nothing.
@ref Art 2, src:58-69
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`Art 2 — the documents that together form the complete contract` MEANS
    LIST "the application, with every form, statement and answer given as evidence of insurability",
         "these product terms",
         "the rider terms",
         "the contract",
         "any approval of the Company with the consent of the policyholder, including later ones"

§§ `Art 2, second paragraph — amendments`

-- src:72 | viết thành văn bản và phải được Tổng giám đốc
-- src:73 | hoặc một Phó Tổng giám đốc của Công ty ký với
@ref Art 2, src:70-74
GIVEN `the signatory` IS A `A signatory for the Company`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 2 — the General Director or a Deputy General Director` `the signatory` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the signatory`
    WHEN `the General Director`      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a Deputy General Director` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `another officer`           THEN FALSE

@ref Art 2, src:70-74
GIVEN `the change` IS AN `An amendment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 2 — the amendment is validly made` `the change` MEANS
        `the change`'s `in writing`
    AND `Art 2 — the General Director or a Deputy General Director` (`the change`'s `signed for the Company by`)
    AND `the change`'s `consented to by the policyholder`
